{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "RoboGAL: Gaga Delta Lady",
    "steam_appid": 3257150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/1eb0db47b305acd5ccd4bd764fc9f944.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In RoboGAL: Gaga Delta Lady you'll help Rei-Bo investigate a spaceship that has crash-landed on Plutobell which will be full of all kinds of traps and enemies! Jump, shoot and slide to overcome all the obstacles in the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/220c317a7822216c95f229db971e2003.poster.avif?t=1754841109\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/220c317a7822216c95f229db971e2003.webm?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/220c317a7822216c95f229db971e2003.mp4?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/50e8e2cf55d791eae8bbae9e788c63f4.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you'll be free to choose where on the spaceship you start! Each stage will have unique visuals, traps and unique enemies. Choose which challenge suits you best! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/66c46d1fe2ccc911ef8912f0e4347dab.poster.avif?t=1754841109\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/66c46d1fe2ccc911ef8912f0e4347dab.webm?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/66c46d1fe2ccc911ef8912f0e4347dab.mp4?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/0e4faf2a6b316eecc271e4ab61c8dac1.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each stage you'll face one of the bosses in the game. Defeat each of them and get their weapons which will help make many of the challenges much easier. A tip: Each boss contains a weakness that will make the battle easier!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/360c04b855eee47cc3deeff8882b9f63.poster.avif?t=1754841109\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/360c04b855eee47cc3deeff8882b9f63.webm?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/360c04b855eee47cc3deeff8882b9f63.mp4?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/a4240dc00495ff4ff4c77067b6869669.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RoboGAL is designed to please those looking for a good challenge, but there will also be room for those who are learning. We've made a challenge that's just right for both those who want a more casual experience and 2D game veterans!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/e16c5a8025f2dd70c235f5cbfab27ecb.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=488 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1754841109\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/1eb0db47b305acd5ccd4bd764fc9f944.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In RoboGAL: Gaga Delta Lady you'll help Rei-Bo investigate a spaceship that has crash-landed on Plutobell which will be full of all kinds of traps and enemies! Jump, shoot and slide to overcome all the obstacles in the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/220c317a7822216c95f229db971e2003.poster.avif?t=1754841109\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/220c317a7822216c95f229db971e2003.webm?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/220c317a7822216c95f229db971e2003.mp4?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/50e8e2cf55d791eae8bbae9e788c63f4.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you'll be free to choose where on the spaceship you start! Each stage will have unique visuals, traps and unique enemies. Choose which challenge suits you best! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/66c46d1fe2ccc911ef8912f0e4347dab.poster.avif?t=1754841109\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/66c46d1fe2ccc911ef8912f0e4347dab.webm?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/66c46d1fe2ccc911ef8912f0e4347dab.mp4?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/0e4faf2a6b316eecc271e4ab61c8dac1.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each stage you'll face one of the bosses in the game. Defeat each of them and get their weapons which will help make many of the challenges much easier. A tip: Each boss contains a weakness that will make the battle easier!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/360c04b855eee47cc3deeff8882b9f63.poster.avif?t=1754841109\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/360c04b855eee47cc3deeff8882b9f63.webm?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/360c04b855eee47cc3deeff8882b9f63.mp4?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/a4240dc00495ff4ff4c77067b6869669.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RoboGAL is designed to please those looking for a good challenge, but there will also be room for those who are learning. We've made a challenge that's just right for both those who want a more casual experience and 2D game veterans!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/e16c5a8025f2dd70c235f5cbfab27ecb.avif?t=1754841109\" data-has-big width=800 height=488 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1754841109\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257150/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1754841109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Plutobell is in trouble! Help Rei-Bo in this action-platformer full of challenges and traps, filled with of cute and silly characters. Choose the stage order, get new weapons as you defeat each boss and test all your skills in RoboGAL!",
